  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往奇利村，出村东门前往角笛大风穴（356.334），击倒水蜘蛛后随机获得【神眼】，全队只需一人获得即可。",
      "type": "chance-item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "◆若队伍中有鉴定师可无需【神眼】",
      "type": "profession-bypass",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "◇本任务推荐将近晚上时分出发",
      "type": "timing-advice",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "◆后续步骤中：",
      "type": "confiscation-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "除【番茄酱】外，其他料理、血瓶、食材、花朵均会被收走。",
      "type": "confiscation-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "包括怀旧服的新手卡赠送的回复生命与魔法的药剂。",
      "type": "confiscation-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "还有道具服的鬼犬普吉。",
      "type": "server-confiscation-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "怀旧服【魔法涌泉】（魔泉：种类不明）不会被收走；",
      "type": "confiscation-exception",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "【再生灵（巨）药】（洗点水）不会被收走；",
      "type": "confiscation-exception",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "◆角笛大风穴为固定迷宫；魔物为Lv.20~22赤目螳螂、水蜘蛛；",
      "type": "maze-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "赤目螳螂，属性：风60火40，昆虫系；技能：攻击、攻击（血少者）、战栗袭心、阳炎",
      "type": "encounter-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "水蜘蛛，属性：水100，昆虫系；技能：攻击、防御、冰冻魔法、强力冰冻魔法",
      "type": "encounter-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "2.夜晚，在索奇亚岛（579~633.275~326）（514~566.337~388）（593~653.332~385）范围内寻找随机出现的3个古代人民任意之一并与之对话，选“是”进入没落的村庄。",
      "type": "night-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "◆没落的村庄：",
      "type": "location-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "完成《风鸣之塔》任务的玩家可利用阿斯提亚镇传送石进入没落的村庄，不需要寻找古代人民；（走法参考《风鸣之塔》任务）",
      "type": "alternate-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "但是注意，进入没落的村庄后再离开，不会传送至古代人民面前。",
      "type": "return-caveat",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "◆古代人民出现区域较大且同一时间可能会有3个，可能出现的坐标示意图：",
      "type": "map-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "注意示意图是范围内都可能出现，而不是固定坐标点",
      "type": "coordinate-warning",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "3.通过（40.39）处楼梯进入连接时空的房间，由持有【神眼】的队员调查连接时空的石盘（12.10），",
      "type": "gate-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "选“是”交出【神眼】，全队传送至帝都阿斯法·地下。",
      "type": "item-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "◆若队伍中有鉴定师可无需【神眼】，由鉴定师调查后直接通过",
      "type": "profession-bypass",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "4.与勇者里雍（21.18）对话，选“是”获得【解咒之法】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "5.与反抗军（35.21）对话，选“是”传送至帝都阿斯法·地下。通过（42.21）处黄色传送石进入罗连斯研究塔。",
      "type": "tower-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        23
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "◆除【番茄酱】外，其他料理、血瓶、食材、花朵均会被收走。",
      "type": "confiscation-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        24
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "包括怀旧服的新手卡赠送的回复生命与魔法的药剂。",
      "type": "confiscation-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        25
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "text": "还有道具服的鬼犬普吉。",
      "type": "server-confiscation-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        26
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
